[{"title":"阙题","author":"岑徵","text":"晴日开长至，招欢池馆中。\n欣逢梅蕊发，赏趁菊花丛。\n乐事兼文酒，偕游杂冠童。\n言寻莲社会，远蹑竹林踪。\n放诞同咸籍，清谈过浑戎。\n行觞严赏罚，坐隐决雌雄。\n有约言终践，幽期月再逢。\n偷閒閒便得，发兴兴难穷。\n大化如翻轴，浮生似转蓬。\n及时须作乐，此会莫教空。\n况有邮诗约，相期雅兴浓。\n格随苏李古，体任柏梁工。\n大雅沦亡久，新声耳目同。\n南园无旧泽，文献绝流风。\n任此狂澜日，宜争砥柱功。\n倒戈甘钝器，拔帜让群公。\n敏捷推年少，濡迟任老翁。\n且宽金谷罚，传览待诗筒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍梧 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"日月开虞代，风声变五弦。\n牂牁流不返，南狩是何年。\n瘴雨摧蓠芷，东风怨杜鹃。\n容华销旅食，泪尽百蛮天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍梧 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"西风沉落日，惆怅鲁阳戈。\n欲上重华墓，陈词荐九歌。\n山分衡岳雪，水隔洞庭波。\n憔悴谁相慰，离忧望汨罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大云山 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"龙驭巡南诏，苍梧罢六军。\n园陵藏日月，海国失风云。\n玉殿伤禾黍，春郊散马群。\n百蛮诸父老，哀痛为斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大云山 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"瘴雨沉佳气，黄尘暗翠微。\n龙蛇无处所，弓剑欲何依。\n白日残金盌，西风脆宝衣。\n陇头啼望帝，昨夜七盘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廉州 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"封域近雕题，黄茅接大堤。\n地临沧海尽，天压郡楼低。\n雾暗秋林叶，风销瘴雨泥。\n浮云望乡国，归梦绕蛮溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廉州 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"粤郡多濒海，廉州土俗殊。\n鸡豚供野鬼，渔猎在明珠。\n贸易唐泉布，山川汉版图。\n最怜秦火烈，并及海潮枯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廉州 其三","author":"岑徵","text":"入望是南溟，孤城控杳冥。\n江分雷水黑，山接大容青。\n日落还珠浦，天荒海角亭。\n樵楼歌折柳，肠断不堪听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"廉州 其四","author":"岑徵","text":"梁鸿虽避地，庑下懒任舂。\n旅食如孤雁，飘零类转蓬。\n马前公府刺，饭后上方钟。\n梦逐飞杉叶，随风直向东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钦州","author":"岑徵","text":"天通侧贰域，路绕马援营。\n山势偏趋海，江流曲抱城。\n酒帘丛贾客，堠火集猺兵。\n信宿蛮烟里，还家梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海幢寺","author":"岑徵","text":"地从虞苑坼，门对白云遥。\n蜃气迷花雨，钟声接海潮。\n花田淹旅食，莲社日相招。\n不学无生法，锱尘何处销。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺思 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"露井鸣秋叶，重楼夜未央。\n悲风连捣素，残月下流黄。\n泪尽珊瑚枕，衾寒玳瑁床。\n亦知愁达曙，无梦到辽阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺思 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"白露下庭草，边风昨夜归。\n征人望秋月，戍妇捣寒衣。\n瀚海黄云合，龙城未解围。\n刀环音信杳，北雁又南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边月","author":"岑徵","text":"一片中天月，寒光满玉关。\n此夜烽烟静，平沙万帐閒。\n作镜临青冢，飞霜染黑山。\n陇头征戍客，怅望损红颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边烽","author":"岑徵","text":"虏骑乘秋入，边烽列障开。\n移时传雁塞，发处认龙堆。\n火势侵云直，军声动地来。\n呼韩知有备，不敢过轮台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边马","author":"岑徵","text":"天马玉花骢，能争绝塞功。\n纵然金作范，不似渥洼中。\n老识阴山路，寒嘶大漠风。\n频年经百战，辛苦护羌同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边草","author":"岑徵","text":"秋霜凋不尽，野烧亦何为。\n大漠连天远，平沙失路歧。\n青归胡后冢，白没李陵碑。\n久戍王孙老，归期总未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边尘","author":"岑徵","text":"起处不因风，纷纷四望同。\n黄云兼扑面，白骨并飞空。\n惨淡交河合，微茫玉塞中。\n年年积金甲，衰老惜英雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀诗 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"端州还楚客，百里绝归心。\n又溯漓江水，扬帆指桂林。\n此行朋从少，到处瘴烟深。\n辛苦年年事，知君罢越吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀诗 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"牂牁西去水，千里共烽烟。\n世事已如此，孤怀空复然。\n定趋衡岳路，或到夜郎天。\n弭节知何处，音书为一传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀诗 其三","author":"岑徵","text":"潇湘三载梦，千里不还乡。\n八口将何托，孤舟更渺茫。\n秋空黄鹄少，天远白云长。\n去住怜同病，忧思不敢忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀诗 其四","author":"岑徵","text":"频年甘作客，湖海任西东。\n纵有垂天翼，高飞无积风。\n气消蛮峤外，泪尽瘴烟中。\n处处同芳草，王孙路不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖南秋兴","author":"岑徵","text":"一雁下平芜，天空楚月孤。\n西风吹叶落，秋色在南湖。\n欲学长沙傅，投书屈大夫。\n三湘哀怨地，怀古独踌蹰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耒阳谒杜少陵墓 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"没处既非假，埋时莫问真。\n先生不可作，大雅向谁陈。\n披草看残碣，临风荐白蘋。\n耒河通汨水，知己有灵均。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耒阳谒杜少陵墓 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"无凭唯白骨，不朽是遗名。\n风雅归唐史，牢骚似屈平。\n荒祠临古渡，疑冢傍孤城。\n魂气千秋在，难忘恋阙情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耒阳谒杜少陵墓 其三","author":"岑徵","text":"迢递辞巴蜀，归魂路恐迷。\n莫言林麓恶，不及浣花溪。\n背郭诸峰抱，前村万木齐。\n西风一凭吊，悽恻罢留题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬耒阳胡使君 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"歧路谁相问，维桑有长官。\n临邛辞犊鼻，安邑就猪肝。\n大海怜萍梗，高枝托羽翰。\n使君敦古谊，长铗不须弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬耒阳胡使君 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"耒江清见底，如带绕城阴。\n我欲学为政，高堂闻素琴。\n三秋兰芷气，千里楚云心。\n旅客岂无病，安眠罢越吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送客之山阴","author":"岑徵","text":"于役竟何事，行行不少留。\n暂为虞苑客，忽作禹陵游。\n日落潮痕长，蝉鸣驿路秋。\n离魂与飘叶，并逐暮江流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠刘濂溪","author":"岑徵","text":"言从孟诸泽，重到尉城阴。\n古调久不作，忽闻流水音。\n秋霜归侠气，春雪上文心。\n爱尔难为赠，兰苕愧短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与关兰仲索兰花","author":"岑徵","text":"频年俱旅食，三径已全荒。\n近有林园兴，移君九畹香。\n昔曾游楚地，结佩采秋霜。\n我本离忧客，沅湘意不忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送离大师还鼎湖","author":"岑徵","text":"閒云同去住，忽向故山归。\n江雨随行锡，梅花点戒衣。\n前期不可问，念别语依依。\n后夜如相忆，钟声隔翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客有赋巴陵诗者和之 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"巴陵形胜好，上将守丸泥。\n飞挽驱三户，前锋用五溪。\n黄云屯郭北，杀气绕城西。\n辛苦长征客，频年事鼓鼙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客有赋巴陵诗者和之 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"高垒掩危旌，金钲昼不惊。\n屯田充国卒，坚壁亚夫营。\n驿马连尘起，哀鸿带雪鸣。\n军中有成算，不敢请长缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七星岩","author":"岑徵","text":"鬼斧惊奇搆，方知造化才。\n天风吹得起，并入夏云堆。\n盖顶青萝现，为屏翡翠开。\n谁能将赋笔，一拟小蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读南园五先生集感赋 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"曲江遗大雅，高庙播文明。\n岂意开元后，重闻正始声。\n吴闽咸避席，关洛仰前型。\n叹息南园地，悲风蔓草平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读南园五先生集感赋 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"风雅登坛日，衣冠建国秋。\n东官隆士礼，西苑上才游。\n白雪沉巴里，黄云暗女牛。\n雅亡离黍降，肠断忆西周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘阴谒三闾庙 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"遗像缘虫篆，空廊污燕泥。\n浮湘魂不散，归郢路长迷。\n帝子山如黛，王孙草又萋。\n千秋有遗恨，长在武关西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘阴谒三闾庙 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"巫阳招不返，魂气傍湘东。\n宿莽中洲尽，长楸故国空。\n悲歌荐兰芷，憔悴想形容。\n千里栖栖客，离忧不可穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿黄皞庵五十一","author":"岑徵","text":"五旬同览揆，令节让君先。\n喜蹑洪厓后，云霄许拍肩。\n暂投松柏咏，共醉菊花筵。\n常侍工佳句，今年胜旧年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠人","author":"岑徵","text":"相闻凤城曲，相识粤城阴。\n赠我如兰芷，投君匪石心。\n花田期素月，纸帐对鸣琴。\n别后如相忆，秋风寄短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘亦庶归广州 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"琼台芳草发，游子恋春晖。\n二月南风正，孤帆破浪飞。\n离情不可极，春梦送将归。\n想到庭闱日，飞花衬綵衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘亦庶归广州 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"同是巢南鸟，分飞惜此辰。\n临流心更苦，酌酒话重陈。\n先我还乡国，因君语故人。\n白头浮海客，归计在明春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙谒屈贾二大夫祠","author":"岑徵","text":"痛哭辞京洛，行吟赴汨罗。\n楚汉文章贱，潇湘哀怨多。\n斜阳临水国，灵雨散山阿。\n弭节荒祠下，凄其荐九歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送圣眉弟公车北上","author":"岑徵","text":"三冬随计吏，五作献长杨。\n向北飞杉贵，辞南细芷香。\n寒梅催别酒，春雪引行装。\n得意归须早，池塘梦正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日同何孟门吴山带黄葵村潘亦庶集吴琬若新楼分赋","author":"岑徵","text":"淹留浑不惜，门馆谢家幽。\n傍柳纡三径，当城出小楼。\n引杯歌楚些，留客看吴钩。\n况有羊何辈，春风共唱酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题洗石泉山居","author":"岑徵","text":"长林莺语密，细路橘花交。\n绝壁开平麓，幽人此结茅。\n凿窗窥涧底，引水过松梢。\n欲买山南地，邻君辟石巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游多异岭","author":"岑徵","text":"一峰边地角，四望杳冥冥。\n涨海将山色，空濛一气青。\n玉尘输橘叟，石髓问仙灵。\n长啸无人和，山猿吟翠屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游灵泉寺","author":"岑徵","text":"扪萝缘磴道，隔叶望危峰。\n云里传钟磬，天边出梵宫。\n听经花雨坠，闻偈法轮空。\n莲社容沽酒，频年事远公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答敏言上人 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"学道辞家早，闻名见面迟。\n不缘通俗姓，那识是亲知。\n梓里交三世，桑门晤一时。\n幸逢莲社约，相与话心期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答敏言上人 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"誓与忘年友，从今密往还。\n肝肠存出世，风雅在名山。\n许我灵洲住，松云共掩关。\n君平殊寂寞，衰老欲投閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄答敏言上人 其三","author":"岑徵","text":"才与文通尽，惭将拟惠休。\n瑶华劳折赠，引羽莫能酬。\n留滞花田畔，相思郁水头。\n梦魂中路阻，烟雨石门秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何孟门之会同 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"蓟北长为客，天南又远征。\n三春浮涨海，一叶背佗城。\n亲友情怀重，琴书结束轻。\n频年霜鬓改，都向路傍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何孟门之会同 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"驿路踰千里，程途未觉遥。\n轻车凡半月，一苇不崇朝。\n腊雪迟新柳，春帆趁暮潮。\n年来重离别，悽恻上河桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何孟门之会同 其三","author":"岑徵","text":"颇怪端山署，招携尽长年。\n壮游随我后，大雅让君先。\n鸡舌频持插，猪肝不取钱。\n琼南风土善，况复主人贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其一","author":"岑徵","text":"行乐小桥东，芒溪踏落红。\n赛神喧社鼓，散学闹村童。\n杂鸟欢晴日，游丝飏晚风。\n言逢隘溪叟，閒话绿阴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其二","author":"岑徵","text":"频年多旅食，三径已全荒。\n草蔓蹲鸱地，藤穿牡蛎墙。\n忘情任牛马，屈指计行藏。\n穷巷谁相问，高歌学楚狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其三","author":"岑徵","text":"为园驱拙仆，上学督诸孙。\n尽日长如此，经春不厌烦。\n落梅黄坠瓦，流水绿当门。\n自得幽栖趣，将寻达者言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其四","author":"岑徵","text":"老至心犹壮，年华暗里迁。\n频添赊酒债，不许买文钱。\n住岂南村宅，耕无北郭田。\n歌声比金石，屡空忆前贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其五","author":"岑徵","text":"鹅肥寒食节，酒熟杏花天。\n相饷烦邻叟，分甘遍稚年。\n放怀尘世外，痛饮绿杨边。\n更约鲥鱼美，招携共泛船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其六","author":"岑徵","text":"蹉跎过岁月，留滞一无成。\n对镜甘衰老，逢人畏后生。\n灰心甜蝶梦，掩耳谢蛙声。\n幸有床头酒，经春未入城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居杂咏 其七","author":"岑徵","text":"寒雨连旬月，荒斋断客过。\n添衣倾箧尽，补屋买茅多。\n竹榻滋苔藓，柴门长薜萝。\n愁霖空有唱，无路觅羊何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵岩寺","author":"岑徵","text":"翠微临震泽，云路背金阊。\n贝叶消前劫，天花散上方。\n一刻繁华地，千秋水月乡。\n山僧语兴废，风雨对绳床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋云","author":"岑徵","text":"岂是人间畜，长空任汝归。\n持来何所赠，孤去独无依。\n触石辞青霭，从龙入紫微。\n高唐神女妒，莫向楚台飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋瀑","author":"岑徵","text":"风雨无朝夕，山灵辟混茫。\n何年寒石裂，迸作九秋霜。\n河汉当空泻，沧溟接派长。\n疏林正萧瑟，吹万尔何藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋原","author":"岑徵","text":"阴气散微霜，平原入望荒。\n野田芜黍稷，衰草集牛羊。\n树绕人烟少，沙回驿路长。\n遥闻海城曲，吹角在斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋屋","author":"岑徵","text":"拮据营竹木，结构在西郊。\n楝岂辛夷架，门从薜荔交。\n莎鸡今在宇，江燕已离巢。\n一似少陵屋，秋风莫破茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋楼","author":"岑徵","text":"层楼高不极，直接暮云堆。\n爽气排空入，秋光四面开。\n青山天外落，孤雁笛边来。\n知有消忧客，谁当作赋才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋塘","author":"岑徵","text":"沿岸飘黄叶，随风散碧波。\n影涵初过雁，香发未残荷。\n小浍分流少，秋霖受水多。\n沙傍菰米熟，好放右军鹅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋镜","author":"岑徵","text":"当秋似明月，负局不曾磨。\n一自盘龙铸，娥眉照几多。\n霜花飞扑面，冰井静无波。\n憔悴兼衰鬓，分明奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]